This product includes software developed at
The Apache Software Foundation (http://www.apache.org/).

The decoder in lib/src (segments, arithmetic and Huffman decoding, MMR, the
bitmap model and the stream readers) is a Dart port of Apache PDFBox JBIG2
ImageIO, formerly levigo JBIG2-ImageIO:

    https://github.com/apache/pdfbox-jbig2

    Copyright 2010-2011 levigo holding gmbh
    Copyright The Apache Software Foundation

The encoder in lib/src/encoder and the public API in lib/src/api are new work
written for this package, and are released under the same licence.

The code tables in lib/src/decoder/huffman/standard_tables.dart and in
lib/src/decoder/mmr/mmr_constants.dart are transcriptions of the tables
published in ITU-T T.88 Annex B and in ITU-T T.4 and T.6. They reached this
package through the Apache port named above and are distributed with it.

No ITU test data is distributed with this package. The conformance fixtures
extracted from ITU-T T.88, which the ITU makes available for non-commercial
use only, live in test/resources and are excluded from the published archive;
their terms are in test/resources/images/README_SAMPLE_DATA_LICENSING.txt and
the full inventory is in test/resources/PROVENANCE.md.
